# Polymers.
mol selection resname PS
mol color ColorID 31
mol representation Licorice 2 12 12 0 1
mol material AOChalky
mol addrep $molid

mol selection resname PEO
mol color ColorID 32
mol representation Licorice 2 12 12 0 1
mol material AOChalky
mol addrep $molid
